00:57:09.230 --> 00:57:11.380
I mean, you are, you know,
you've been living in France

00:57:11.380 --> 00:57:15.150
for awhile, you've been
experiencing, I know, or, you know

00:57:15.150 --> 00:57:17.990
writing about the rise in antisemitism.

00:57:17.990 --> 00:57:20.560
So what does your book have to tell us?

00:57:20.560 --> 00:57:23.130
How does it help us
understand the situation?

00:57:23.130 --> 00:57:26.950
You know, that is such a good
and complicated question.

00:57:26.950 --> 00:57:28.360
You know, I'm not

00:57:28.360 --> 00:57:31.449
I'm not really sure I've
thought a lot about this.

00:57:31.449 --> 00:57:33.298
My, I don't really know
what the answer is.

00:57:33.298 --> 00:57:35.870
I mean, on the one hand,
I think, you know, just

00:57:35.870 --> 00:57:40.150
just very briefly antisemitism
today is Besley different

00:57:40.150 --> 00:57:41.283
than antisemitism.

00:57:42.772 --> 00:57:45.490
Then it has a whole other kind
of discourse and narrative.

00:57:45.490 --> 00:57:48.855
It has different origins
and different history to it.

00:57:48.855 --> 00:57:50.483
I mean, it really is different.

00:57:50.483 --> 00:57:51.776
I mean, now it is.

00:57:51.776 --> 00:57:52.944
I mean, it's, again

00:57:52.944 --> 00:57:53.777
it's the words are so important in this.

00:57:53.777 --> 00:57:56.470
So let me, let me try to
summarize it succinctly

00:57:56.470 --> 00:57:59.560
but essentially, you
know, the, the majority

00:57:59.560 --> 00:58:01.550
of anti-Semitic violence that we see

00:58:01.550 --> 00:58:03.700
in France today is perpetrated

00:58:03.700 --> 00:58:08.700
by authors with a similar
cultural background.

00:58:09.274 --> 00:58:11.530
And that is often a kind

00:58:11.530 --> 00:58:16.410
of third generation
immigrants from Frances

00:58:16.410 --> 00:58:17.720
former colonies in north
Africa or west Africa.

00:58:17.720 --> 00:58:19.270
And so that is a vastly different, I mean

00:58:19.270 --> 00:58:21.997
of course I should say,
you know, there is the

00:58:21.997 --> 00:58:25.866
the lingering specter
of the national front

00:58:25.866 --> 00:58:27.323
