00:58:27.323 --> 00:58:31.139
the violent attacks that we see come

00:58:31.139 --> 00:58:33.697
from a kind of a different source today.

00:58:33.697 --> 00:58:37.722
And, you know, I'm not sure
that it is the same story

00:58:37.722 --> 00:58:42.722
or that there really is
a lesson to be drawn.

00:58:43.984 --> 00:58:47.460
And it's, it's, it's tricky
because of course, you know

00:58:47.460 --> 00:58:51.280
you want to feel like your,
your work will explain kind

00:58:51.280 --> 00:58:54.816
of current events, but I'm
not sure that that mine really

00:58:54.816 --> 00:58:56.118
